OL,3,GNEWSAMan no longer faces murder charge 
OL,4,Aover girl's death                      
OL,6,FA man is no longer facing a murder     
OL,7,Fcharge following the death of an       
OL,8,F18-month-old girl on the Isle of Wight.
OL,10,FJayla-Jean McLaren suffered serious    
OL,11,Finjuries and died in hospital on 3     
OL,12,FAugust 2025.                           
OL,14,FHampshire Police said after a review of
OL,15,Fthe evidence by the Crown Prosecution  
OL,16,FService, Adrian Lawton, 32, of Dairy   
OL,17,FCrest Drive, Newport, is no longer     
OL,18,Fcharged with murder. He is instead     
OL,19,Fcharged with allowing the death of a   
OL,20,Fchild and two counts of cruelty to a   
OL,21,Fperson under 16 years.                 
