OL,3,GNEWSAMan no longer faces murder charge 
OL,4,Aover girl's death                      
OL,6,FSamara Glover, 28, of the same address,
OL,7,Fremains charged with murder and causing
OL,8,For allowing the death of a child. Both 
OL,9,Fare due to appear at Portsmouth Crown  
OL,10,FCourt on 18 December.                  
